printIt argument text String summaryText lend
printIt result none
printIt ownedBy none
printIt cleanedBy none
printIt borrows none
printIt catch printError console.WriteError
printIt suppresses none

joinReadFailed is call
joinReadFailed in main
joinReadFailed invokes string.concat
joinReadFailed argument left String sourcePath lend
joinReadFailed argument right String readFailedText lend
joinReadFailed argument region Region store lend
joinReadFailed result readFailedMessage String
joinReadFailed ownedBy store
joinReadFailed cleanedBy none
joinReadFailed borrows none
joinReadFailed catch none
joinReadFailed suppresses none

writeReadFailed is call
writeReadFailed rationale "The exit code already says a file failed; a lost message does not change it"
writeReadFailed in main
writeReadFailed invokes console.writeError
writeReadFailed argument text String readFailedMessage lend
writeReadFailed result none
writeReadFailed ownedBy none
writeReadFailed cleanedBy none
writeReadFailed borrows none
writeReadFailed catch readFailedError console.WriteError
writeReadFailed suppresses console.WriteError.failed

joinWriteFailed is call
joinWriteFailed in main
joinWriteFailed invokes string.concat
joinWriteFailed argument left String outputPath lend
joinWriteFailed argument right String writeFailedText lend
joinWriteFailed argument region Region store lend
joinWriteFailed result writeFailedMessage String
joinWriteFailed ownedBy store
joinWriteFailed cleanedBy none
joinWriteFailed borrows none
joinWriteFailed catch none
joinWriteFailed suppresses none

writeWriteFailed is call
writeWriteFailed rationale "The exit code already says a file failed; a lost message does not change it"
writeWriteFailed in main
writeWriteFailed invokes console.writeError
writeWriteFailed argument text String writeFailedMessage lend
writeWriteFailed result none
writeWriteFailed ownedBy none
writeWriteFailed cleanedBy none
writeWriteFailed borrows none
writeWriteFailed catch writeFailedError console.WriteError
writeWriteFailed suppresses console.WriteError.failed
